@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@requestId = REQ替换为你的requestId
@payOrderId = 1
@cancelOrderId = 1
@token = idem_替换为正常下单token


### 0. 获取幂等 token
### 执行后复制 data.token 到 @token。
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token?userId=1


### 1. 正常异步下单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "showId": 1,
  "sessionId": 1,
  "ticketCategoryId": 2,
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{token}}"
}


### 2. 快速多次异步下单，触发用户级限流
### 说明：用户级规则为 10 秒 5 次。第 6 次开始应返回“请求过于频繁，请稍后再试”。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "showId": 1,
  "sessionId": 1,
  "ticketCategoryId": 2,
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "idem_rate_limit_test_1"
}

